flowchart LR
 AI["PCのAI: Claude / Codex / Cursor / Grok"] -->|stdio MCP| MCP["connector/mcp.ts runMcp"]
 MCP -->|JSON + connection Bearer| HTTP["server/http.ts createApp"]
 CLOUD["リモートAI"] -->|POST /mcp + connection Bearer| RMCP["remote-mcp.ts remoteMcpHandler"]
 RMCP --> DEC["decisions.ts Decisions"]
 HTTP --> DEC
 HTTP --> ACC["accounts.ts Accounts / OIDC"]
 HTTP --> ATT["attachments.ts Attachments"]
 HTTP --> OPS["diagnostics.ts / appstore.ts"]
 WEB["web: App / pages / api.ts"] -->|/v1 + session Bearer| HTTP
 NATIVE["外部native apps: api.md契約まで"] -->|/v1 JSON / binary / SSE| HTTP
 DEC --> DB[("db.ts SQLite schema9 / files")]
 ACC --> DB
 ATT --> DB
 OPS --> DB
 DEC -->|取引commit後| EV["events.ts EventHub"]
 EV -->|SSE: 再取得の合図| WEB
 EV -->|APNs: 機能完了とは別| NATIVE
 EV -->|connection wake| DAEMON["connector/daemon.ts journal"]
 DAEMON -->|GET deliveries / POST report| HTTP
 DAEMON -->|sendChannelAnswer| STEER["外部aiterm-steer-delivery / Aiterm"]
 STEER -->|元channelへ受付/出力| AI
 EV --> CB["callbridge.ts CallBridgeDeliverer"]
 CB -->|open/send/hangup| BRIDGE["外部call-bridge"]
 BRIDGE --> CLOUD
